:1},{"i":"58:21:3","a":"لَأَغْلِبَنَّ","t":"Surely, I will overcome","p":"V","tr":"la-aghlibanna","f":["IMPF","1S"],"r":295,"l":628,"g":[["لَ","EMPH","prefix","l:EMPH"],["أَغْلِبَ","V","stem","IMPF|1S"],["نَّ","EMPH","suffix","+n:EMPH"]]},{"i":"58:21:4","a":"أَنَا۠","t":"I","p":"PRON","tr":"anā","f":["1S"],"l":180},{"i":"58:21:5","a":"وَرُسُلِىٓ ۚ","t":"and My Messengers","p":"N","tr":"warusulī","f":["MP","NOM"],"r":11,"l":35,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["رُسُلِ","N","stem","MP|NOM"],["ىٓ","PRON","suffix","PRON:1S"]]},{"i":"58:21:6","a":"إِنَّ","t":"Indeed","p":"ACC","tr":"inna","l":5},{"i":"58:21:7","a":"ٱللَّهَ","t":"Allah","p":"PN","tr":"l-laha","f":["ACC"],"r":0,"l":1},{"i":"58:21:8","a":"قَوِىٌّ","t":"(is) All-Strong","p":"ADJ","tr":"qawiyyun","f":["MS","INDEF","NOM"],"r":232,"l":798},{"i":"58:21:9","a":"عَزِيزٌۭ","t":"All-Mighty","p":"ADJ","tr":"ʿazīzun","f":["MS","INDEF","NOM"],"r":95,"l":110},{"e":"٢١","v":"58:21"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"58:12","t":"O you who have believed, when you [wish to] privately consult the Messenger, present before your consultation a charity. That is better for you and purer. But if you find not [the means] - then indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"58:13","t":"Have you feared to present before your consultation charities? Then when you do not and Allāh has forgiven you, then [at least] establish prayer and give zakāh and obey Allāh and His Messenger. And Allāh is Aware of what you do.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"58:14","t":"Have you not considered those who make allies of a people with whom Allāh has become angry? They are neither of you nor of them, and they swear to untruth while they know [they are lying].","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"58:15","t":"Allāh has prepared for them a severe punishment. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"58:16","t":"They took their [false] oaths as a cover, so they averted [people] from the way of Allāh, and for them is a humiliating punishment.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"58:17","t":"Never will their wealth or their children avail them against Allāh at all. Those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"58:18","t":"On the Day Allāh will resurrect them all, and they will swear to Him as they swear to you and think that they are [standing] on something. Unquestionably, it is they who are the liars.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"58:19","t":"Satan has overcome them and made them forget the remembrance of Allāh. Those are the party of Satan. Unquestionably, the party of Satan - they will be the losers.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"58:20","t":"Indeed, the ones who oppose Allāh and His Messenger - those will be among the most humbled.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"58:21","t":"Allāh has written [i.e., decreed], \"I will surely overcome, I and My messengers.\" Indeed, Allāh is Powerful and Exalted in Might.","j":28,"h":55,"s":58,"a":21,"sd":null}],"juz":28,"hizb":55,"surahs":[58],"sajdah":false}